## Live Shockbyte sync

**FileZilla / local handoff folders:**

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `E:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Server Handoffs\1. RootMC - Claims\` | **Claims** — live-synced |
| `E:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Server Handoffs\2. RootMC - Towny\` | **Towny** — upload this for Towny work |
| `E:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\Server Handoffs\3. RootMC - Test Server\` | Test / local staging |

Stage only the intended host's jars into the matching `plugins\` folder and remove older same-plugin versions before upload.

Do **not** use legacy `D:\RootMC Workspace\`, `D:\old\RootMC Workspace\`, `Desktop/RootMC`, `Minecraft/server/host-handoff/`, `D:\Gen1\`, or `D:\Gen3 Current Handoff\` as deploy targets.

## Build & deploy (from this workspace)

```bat
cd "Plugin Building\Minecraft"
.\build-with-server-jdk.bat publishPlugins
```

```powershell
powershell -File "Web Files\rootmc-api\deploy.ps1"
```

```powershell
cd "Web Files\rootmc-web"
powershell -File deploy.ps1
```

```bat
cd "Mobile App Files\rootmc-android"
.\gradlew.bat bundleRelease assembleRelease
```

## Secrets

- **Primary:** `E:\.1 Work Stations\RootMC\.env` (D twin mirrored)
- **Fallback:** `E:\.1 Work Stations\.credentials\.env` then `D:\.1 Work Stations\.credentials\.env`
- **Live server auth:** `Server Handoffs/1. RootMC - Claims/plugins/RootMC/cloud.yml`, `Server Handoffs/2. RootMC - Towny/plugins/RootMC/cloud.yml`
- Script path helper: `Web Files/rootmc-realm-api/scripts/lib/rootmc-paths.mjs`
- Deploy env loader: `scripts/load-rootmc-env.ps1`

## Agent behavior

- Minimal diffs; Gold not dollars in player-facing copy
- No Discord posts unless user asks
- **Ava Slack/Discord:** never Cursor Slack MCP for Ava voice — it posts as Alex. Use `AVA_SLACK_BOT_TOKEN` / `AVA_DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN` via `Web Files/rootmc-ava/src/avaPost.mjs` or `scripts/post-as-ava.mjs`. See `.cursor/rules/ava-identity-posts.mdc`.
- **Daily-plan phase catch-up:** after every phase/update while working as Ava, run `node Web Files/rootmc-ava/scripts/phase-catchup.mjs <phase-label>` so she replies + reacts to catch up. See `.cursor/rules/ava-phase-catchup.mdc`.
- No builds/deploys/commits unless user asks
- Keep `PLUGIN_RELEASES` in sync with `rootmc-web/public/plugins/manifest.json` when bumping heartbeat plugins
- User runs `commit-all.bat` / FileZilla / Shockbyte restart unless explicitly asked

